<title>INDIA: India TISCO 1996/97 net seen up 0.9 pct.</title>
<headline>India TISCO 1996/97 net seen up 0.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tata Iron and Steel Company Ltd (TISCO) will see a marginal 0.9 percent rise in net profit to 5.7 billion rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, a Reuter poll found.</p>
<p>Analysts at 28 leading securities and brokerage firms</p>
<p>forecast a low of 4.78 billion rupees and a high of 6.42</p>
<p>billion rupees against 5.66 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>TISCO   ----PAT seen up 0.92%, sales up 3.08%</p>
<p>		     Net profit   1995/96    Net sales   1995/96</p>
<p>				(in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average		5,710.16  5,657.90    60,343.22  58,541.20</p>
<p>High		   6,426.00		  71,420.00</p>
<p>Low		    4,786.08		  54,453.00</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
